<title>NETHERLANDS: DE DRIE 1996 NET PROFIT FLAT.</title>
<headline>DE DRIE 1996 NET PROFIT FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31,1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.09 vs   1.10 </p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.31 vs   1.26</p>
<p>    Turnover				14.1  vs  15.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.66 vs   2.17</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges/gains gain 0.07 vs   0.48 charge</p>
<p>Note - Full name is De Drie Electronics. The company said it</p>
<p>had brought forward the publication of its results by a</p>
<p>fortnight in view of current price trends in its shares on the</p>
<p>Amsterdam Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.50 vs   8.00</p>
<p>NOTE: De Drie Electronics said that barring unforeseen</p>
<p>circumstances it expected to hold 1997 profits steady at 1996</p>
<p>levels, while turnover was expected to pick up slightly.</p>
<p>Last year the company paid out a portion of its excess</p>
<p>liquid assets.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
